--- !u!114 &1104020828
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1104020827}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: NOVA REACHED KHAN'S LOCATION FIRST - SHE HAD RECEIVED A MESSAGE VIA PIGEON
      WHEN ONE OF HER INFORMANTS SAW THE MASTER HIDE THE BLADE BENEATH A PILE OF
      STONES
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  - text: HOWEVER, HER SISTERS WERE NOT FAR BEHIND. ROSE EMERGED AS NOVA'S FIRST
      CHALLENGER, AND ROSE'S MASTERY OF HER BODY WAS SO GREAT THAT EVEN WITH THE
      MIGHT OF KHAN, NOVA STRUGGLED TO MATCH HER.
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  - text: 'ROSE HELD BACK, AFRAID TO HURT HER YOUNGER SISTER. BUT THEN SHE BEGAN
      HEARING THE VOICES.

      THE VOICES TOLD HER SHE WAS WEAK. THAT TRUE STRENGTH
      LAY RIGHT BEFORE HER'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  - text: AND SO, WITH A SWIFT DISARM, SHE WRESTLED THE BLADE FROM NOVA'S HANDS AND
      SHE KILLED
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
