--- !u!114 &1350987208
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1350987207}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: MEANWHILE, THE HEIR OF THE SWORD, CRYSTAL, HAD A DAUGHTER OF HER OWN. HER
      NAME WAS JADE, AND SHE WAS EVEN MORE GIFTED IN THE PSYCHIC ARTS THAN EVEN CRYSTAL
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: 
  - text: 'BUT THE GRANDMASTER''S ENEMIES HAD GOTTEN STRONGER TOO. CRYSTAL WAS KILLED
      BY A RAGING BALD MANIAC WHEN JADE WAS ONLY TEN. '
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: 
  - text: JADE WAS ADOPTED BY HER BEST FRIEND STORM AND THEIR FAMILY. THEY HAD NO
      ABILITIES OR CLAIM TO THE THRONE, BUT DUE TO SHEER LUCK, THEY HAD BECOME THE
      WIELDERS OF THE WORLD'S GREATEST WEAPON
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: 
  - text: SOME SAY NOVA LEFT A LEGACY OF HER OWN AS WELL. SOME SAY HER NINJA INFORMANTS
      ARE STILL OUT THERE HIDING IN PLAIN SIGHT. SOME BELIEVE THEY HAVE SEEN HER
      GHOST
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: 
  - text: 'AFTER ALL, THAT IS KHAN''S POWER - TO KEEP THE SOULS IT HOLDS ALIVE. AS
      LONG AS KHAN EXISTS, NOVA WILL LIVE ON.

      LONG LIVE NOVA!!!'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
